    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop and let the noise fade away\"... what do you mean by that exactly?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It means you don't have to force yourself to keep going, to work, or to pretend everything is fine when it isn't. The \"noise\" is the constant pressure to perform and the fear that you're failing, and letting it fade away is the act of simply stopping and allowing yourself to exist without that pressure. You can just sit in the silence and let the weight of the universe lift off your shoulders for a while, without needing to find meaning in it.",
